        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "93d30641-804b-3999-8858-ace9550b357f",
                "word": "jovialement",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f7fa7857-40be-3bf8-8c32-fbdc31250c08",
                        "entry_id": "93d30641-804b-3999-8858-ace9550b357f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "D’une manière joviale."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e79786e6-df1b-4e54-a9ab-1b16f5134cbb",
                                "sense_id": "f7fa7857-40be-3bf8-8c32-fbdc31250c08",
                                "text": "Elle l’accueillit jovialement dans son humble masure."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0359b012-7eb7-460b-aa03-0e56c1e38714",
                        "source_entry_id": "93d30641-804b-3999-8858-ace9550b357f",
                        "source_sense_id": "f7fa7857-40be-3bf8-8c32-fbdc31250c08",
                        "target_lang_word": "jovially",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "jovially",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e501b567-40df-30c0-98fa-9b82dcd6eef6",
                                        "entry_id": "dd68b085-d3d4-3cb0-867e-8720db94f6f8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Under the astrological influence of the planet Jupiter."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "314c3721-aaf1-4913-9797-05a9dc97893d",
                                                "sense_id": "e501b567-40df-30c0-98fa-9b82dcd6eef6",
                                                "text": "Some are of the opinion, that the world was made, to giue a body in lieu of puniſhment, vnto the ſpirits, which through their fault were fallen from the puritie, wherin they were created: The firſt creation having beene incorporeal. And that according as they have more or leſſe elonged themſelves from their ſpirituallitie, ſo they are more or leſſe merilie & Giovially, or rudely and Saturnally incorporated: Whence proceedeth the infinite varietie of ſo much matter created."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4268be48-b42e-395a-ba40-52383bdb4ff1",
                                        "entry_id": "dd68b085-d3d4-3cb0-867e-8720db94f6f8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a jovial (“cheerful and good-humoured”) manner; jollily, merrily."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac6cbf1d-000a-4a97-829d-7c77008ae967",
                                                "sense_id": "4268be48-b42e-395a-ba40-52383bdb4ff1",
                                                "text": "The seasoning of a play is the applause. / Now, though the Foxe be punish'd by the lawes, / He, yet, doth hope there is no suffring due, / For any fact, which he hath done 'gainst you; / If there be, sensure him: here he, doubtfull, stands. / If not, fare iouially, and clap your hands."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "955200ab-8401-4306-8c55-fa0313218695",
                                                "sense_id": "4268be48-b42e-395a-ba40-52383bdb4ff1",
                                                "text": "This enforced solitarinesse takes place, and produceth this effect soonest in such, as haue spent their time Iouially peraduenture in all honest recreations, in all good company, and are vpon a sudden confined, and restrained of their liberty, and barred from their ordinary associats: solitarinesse is very irkesome to such, most tedious, and a sudden cause of great inconvenience."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "30233d4f-d126-4885-882f-8d986c6271b7",
                                                "sense_id": "4268be48-b42e-395a-ba40-52383bdb4ff1",
                                                "text": "After they had put their Affairs in a proper Diſpoſition aboard, they went ashore to a little Village for Refreshments, and lived jovially the remaining Part of the Day, at a Tavern, spending three Pistols, and then departed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b4b0cd3d-2662-4988-bf70-81fdd71f9d22",
                                                "sense_id": "4268be48-b42e-395a-ba40-52383bdb4ff1",
                                                "text": "Life there was at its usual nocturnal ferment. A few of the men were jovially drunk, a few of them savagely so."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e4eb437-99c6-44dd-b095-b8688233c521",
                                                "sense_id": "4268be48-b42e-395a-ba40-52383bdb4ff1",
                                                "text": "He greeted Milo jovially each time they met and, in an excess of contrite generosity, impulsively recommended Major Major for promotion."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
